      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "例 4 选择适当的方法表示下列集合：",
            "(1) 大于 $0$ 且小于 $10$ 的全体偶数组成的集合 $A$；",
            "(2) 被 $3$ 除余 $2$ 的所有自然数组成的集合 $B$；",
            "(3) 直角坐标平面上由第二象限与第四象限中的所有点组成的集合 $C$."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p12_b2",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        140,
        220,
        660,
        370
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "解 (1) 用列举法：$A=\\{2,4,6,8\\}$.",
            "(2) 用描述法：$B=\\{n \\mid n=3k+2, k \\in \\mathbb{N}\\}$.",
            "(3) 因为第二象限中所有点 $(x,y)$ 具有的特征是 $x<0$ 且 $y>0$，而第四象限中所有点具有的特征是 $x>0$ 且 $y<0$，所以第二象限与第四象限中所有点具有的特征可统一地写为 $xy<0$，于是可用描述法表示该集合："
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p12_eq1",
      "kind": "equation",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "equation",
      "bbox": [
        280,
        350,
        470,
        370
      ],
      "anchor_id": "p12_b2",
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": null,
        "table": null,
        "equation": {
          "latex": "C=\\{(x,y) \\mid xy<0\\}",
          "fallback_text": "C={(x,y) | xy<0}"
        },
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p12_b3",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "definition",
      "bbox": [
        90,
        380,
        660,
        530
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "数学中，常常需要表示满足一些不等式的全体实数所组成的集合. 为了方便起见，我们引入区间 (interval) 的概念.",
            "当 $a, b \\in \\mathbf{R}$ 且 $a<b$ 时，规定：",
            "满足不等式 $a \\leqslant x \\leqslant b$ 的全体实数 $x$ 组成的集合称为一个闭区间，记作 $[a,b]$.",
            "满足不等式 $a<x<b$ 的全体实数 $x$ 组成的集合称为一个开区间，记作 $(a,b)$."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p12_b4",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        130,
        540,
        580,
        555
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "闭区间与开区间在数轴上的表示，如图 1-1-1 所示."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p12_f1",
      "kind": "figure",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "figure",
      "bbox": [
        160,
        560,
        590,
        620
      ],
      "anchor_id": "p12_b4",
      "figure_group_id": "p12_f1",
      "content": {
        "text": null,
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": {
          "caption": "图 1-1-1"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p12_b5",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "definition",
      "bbox": [
        90,
        650,
        660,
        695
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "满足不等式 $a \\leqslant x<b$ 或 $a<x \\leqslant b$ 的全体实数 $x$ 所组成的集合称为一个半开半闭区间，分别记作 $[a,b)$ 或 $(a,b]$."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p12_b6",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        130,
